Third-party services referenced (not bundled)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Pool subsystem can integrate with the following external services. Each is
governed by its own Terms of Service. Use of any of these is the operator's
responsibility:

  * mail.tm                — disposable email API
  * 5sim.net               — paid SMS verification numbers
  * sms-activate.org       — paid SMS verification numbers (alternative)
  * Telegram Bot API       — operator alerting

Logos / brand names
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The original "new-api" logo at web/public/logo.png remains the property of the
upstream project. If you fork this project further and rebrand it, replace
the logo and all "new-api" references in your fork's user-facing strings.
